{"version":1,"key":"quest:134","content":{"id":134,"title":"inert 属性的作用是什么？","summary":"暂未记录答案","target":{"key":"quest:134","type":"quest","id":134},"groupId":2,"groupTitle":"前端","groupColor":"mint-green","status":"resolved","answers":[],"materials":[{"index":1,"kind":"card","group":"note","title":"HTML inert 属性和 CSS interactivity 属性","meta":"","excerpt":"inert 是 HTML 的一个全局布尔属性，它指示浏览器忽略该元素以及子元素，无法与该元素进行任何交互，看得见摸不着。 设置 inert 属性后： 无法触发任何鼠标事件，包括点击、鼠标移动、触摸、指针事件等文本内容无法选中，就像设置了 user-select: none 一样无法被聚焦，也无法触发 focus 事件无","target":{"key":"card:671","type":"card","id":671},"citeKey":"card:671"}],"trail":[{"time":1768491016908,"tone":"start","text":"提出问题","refs":[]},{"time":1768736259482,"tone":"milestone","text":"写下卡片","refs":[1]},{"time":1768736259494,"tone":"done","text":"标为已解决","refs":[]}],"description":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"createTime":1768491016908,"updateTime":1768491016908,"resolvedTime":1768736259494},"meta":{"type":"quest","publishTime":1768491016908}}